---
// Homepage blueprint section 5. Large scale campaign typography on the
// editorial surface.
---

<section class="campaign" data-surface="editorial">
  <div class="campaign-inner">
    <h2>We are the first generation with the courage to begin.</h2>
    <p>
      Future generations will judge us not by whether the crisis was
      convenient, but by whether we started a planning process early
      enough.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .campaign {
    background: var(--paper);
    color: var(--ink);
  }

  .campaign-inner {
    max-width: var(--page-max);
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-4);
    text-align: center;
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: var(--text-3xl);
    max-width: 22ch;
    margin: 0 auto var(--space-4);
  }

  p {
    font-size: var(--text-lg);
    color: var(--gray-700);
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
</style>
